-Admission JSON contract
-Top-level {schema_version, synthetic:false, examples:[...]}.
-Each example needs example_id, lineage_id, study_id, chemistry, sequence, equal-
-length reactivity/stderr/observed_mask/coordinates vectors, secondary_dot_bracket,
-admission:{eligible:true, geometry_compatibility:...}, and source/mapping
-provenance. Missing observations/errors/coordinates use null (not fabricated zero).
-Each coordinate is a finite C4-prime [x,y,z] vector in angstrom. The optional
-context object supports temperature_c, ph, magnesium_mm, monovalent_mm and
-ligand_um only. Unrecorded context is absent/null, never inferred from outcomes.
-An independent scientific admission review must define chemistry masks and
-lineage grouping before the model script is run.
